- DISP 3 is back in the live style: REC chip, timecode, larger tiles.
- Instant review covers RAW-only, turns sharp for RAW+JPEG and appears sooner.
- A shutter tap in CL/CH takes one photo; hold for a burst. Tap-to-focus no longer sticks busy.
- The GYRO pill no longer covers the lock. Shots left show as a picture icon and count, following the stills card.
- Take-over asks first; reconnecting keeps stills or video and wakes an unseen saved camera.
